  "goodToKnow": "Die Teilhabe is participation or inclusion: soziale Teilhabe, kulturelle Teilhabe. It's a key word in German social policy: das Bundesteilhabegesetz (2016) reformed support for people with disabilities, and the Bildungs- und Teilhabepaket helps low-income children join school trips and sports clubs. Teilhaben an means to share in. Der Teilhaber is a business partner. It has no plural."
